<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-SUMMARIES OF GERMAN FIRST DIVISION MATCHES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES OF GERMAN FIRST DIVISION MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of German first division</p>
<p>matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Bochum 3 (Donkow 33rd minute, Wosz 72nd, 82nd). Karlsruhe 1</p>
<p>(Haessler 70th penalty). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 20,498.</p>
<p>St Pauli 0 Werder Bremen 3 (Herzog 26nd, Bode 42nd, Labbadia</p>
<p>50th). 0-2. 19,928.</p>
<p>Hansa Rostock 0 Borussia Dortmund 1 (Cesar 90th). 0-0. 24,000.</p>
<p>Bayern Munich 1 (Ziege 59th) Arminia Bielefeld 0. 0-0. 55,000.</p>
<p>Duisburg 0 Schalke 1 (Max 45th). 0-1. 21,500.</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen 3 (Happe 2nd, Kirsten 19th, 88th) 1860 Munich</p>
<p>0. 2-0. 19,000.</p>
